&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SageMaker (4.0.15.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This release adds the ability for customers to attach and detach their EBS volumes to EKS-orchestrated HyperPod cluster nodes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core 4.0.0.20
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update HTTP handler to handle scenario where content stream position is not zero (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3281322905" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941/hovercard" href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941"&gt;#3941&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All services packages updated to require new Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/releases/tag/3.7.1094.0"&gt;3.7.1094.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;3.7.1094.0 (2025-08-04 21:42 UTC)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockAgentCore (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove superfluous field from API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CodeConnections (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New integration with Azure DevOps provider type.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evs (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TagResource API now throws ServiceQuotaExceededException when the number of tags on the Amazon EVS resource exceeds the maximum allowed. TooManyTagsException is deprecated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IoTSiteWise (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Interface for IoT SiteWise Asset Modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SageMaker (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This release adds the ability for customers to attach and detach their EBS volumes to EKS-orchestrated HyperPod cluster nodes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core 3.7.500.2
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update HTTP handler to handle scenario where content stream position is not zero (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3281322905" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941/hovercard" href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/3941"&gt;#3941&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating endpoints.json file.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All services packages updated to require new Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
